ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/202610072324487308_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/202610072324487308_720.jpg"> </div><p>【梅西发社媒，C罗评论】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac689d132da0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗点赞＆评论梅西：你留下的历史将被永远铭记，给你一个拥抱！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.3" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080231496276_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.3" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.3" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080231496276_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080231496276_1280.jpg"> </div><p>北京时间今日凌晨，梅西在个人社媒更新动态，纪念自己的国家队告别赛。C罗也对这条动态进行了点赞和评论。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac6898773531native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">告别国家队！梅西社媒：这是一段不可思议的旅程，会永远感谢你们</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080231373500.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080231373500_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080231373500_720.jpg"> </div><p>在阿根廷国家队告别战后，梅西发布社媒。他回顾了自己对国家队生涯的感受，并对所有的朋友、队友、主教练及团队成员表达了感谢。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac68cde6f740native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗时隔近3个月后再次评论梅西动态，上一次是安慰梅西悼念父亲帖</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.17" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080228246566.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.17" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.17" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080228246566_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080228246566_720.jpg"> </div><p>上一次C罗在梅西的社媒动态下互动还要追溯到8月初，当时梅西发表了一则长文悼念已故的父亲。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac69a0b0c103native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">安东内拉发文致梅西：能够一路陪你走过这段旅程，我无比骄傲</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.3" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080315332331_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.3" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.3" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080315332331_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261008/202610080315332331_720.jpg"> </div><p>在国家队告别赛后，梅西更新社媒，发表了一篇言辞真挚的感言。随后，梅西妻子安东内拉也发了一篇社媒动态，表示自己能陪伴梅西一路走来，感到非常骄傲。</p><p>【C罗遭媒体集火】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac686fe1e0cdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">镜报长文批判C罗：他已被妄想吞噬，他的话如失势君主的高烧呓语</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58ae0ec458_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58ae0ec458.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/6ab58ae0ec458.jpg"> </div><p>镜报资深记者Harry Brent撰写长文，就C罗近期的国家队风波，以及前一日C罗发布的声明做出了评价。Harry Brent用词辛辣，直言C罗如今已经被妄想吞噬。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-07/6ac66639d6f43native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">泰晤士：C罗的自欺欺人到了新高度 一个踢猪尿泡的把自己当救世主</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261002/6abefc01187d2_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261002/6abefc01187d2_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261002/6abefc01187d2_1280.jpg"> </div><p>泰晤士报记者马修·赛义德发布专栏文章，谈到了C罗与葡萄牙国家队的风波。题为《C罗的自欺欺人又上新台阶，自我妄想的杰作》。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac69a01965dcnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：为何热苏斯没按C罗自称商定的口径说 或许是他想起还有自尊？</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/6ac5c2f7ab17a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/6ac5c2f7ab17a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/6ac5c2f7ab17a.jpg"> </div><p>C罗通过葡媒和个人社媒发布声明，回顾自己退出本期的风波始末。The Athletic记者Nick Miller撰写社论文章评论了这一事件。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac691678ea68native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">BBC：赖斯接近与阿森纳续约！新合同周薪与萨卡的35万镑相近</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260910/6aa1cffb30fc9_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260910/6aa1cffb30fc9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260910/6aa1cffb30fc9.jpg"> </div><p>BBC消息，赖斯接近与阿森纳完成续约，并且他的薪资将大幅提高，与队内顶薪萨卡的35万镑周薪相近。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac671f12ea45native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：拉波尔塔是梅西回巴萨办告别赛的障碍 双方芥蒂一直未消除</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261008/202610080026101900.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261008/202610080026101900.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261008/202610080026101900.jpg"> </div><p>TA记者Pol Ballús撰文，分析了为什么梅西至今仍未在巴塞罗那获得一场致敬的告别赛，以及未来是否还有举办的可能。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-08/6ac6cbe3730aenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">队报：土耳其主帅蒙特拉即将下课，图兰是热门接班人选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/6a3702e467a7b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/6a3702e467a7b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/6a3702e467a7b.jpg"> </div><p>据《队报》报道称，土耳其主帅蒙特拉即将下课，图兰是热门接班人选。</p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/index.html?id=165" class="hide" style="     background: url('http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200905/zt_4221599266620.png') no-repeat;     background-size: cover;     display: block;     height: 150px;     max-width: 690px;     color: white;     margin: 24px auto;     position: relative;     border-radius: 10px;     overflow: hidden; ">     <div style="     position: absolute;     height: 50px;     line-height: 50px;     font-size: 16px;     left: 0;     bottom: 0;     right: 0;     text-indent: 15px;     background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);     color:white; ">直播吧足球早报-早看早知道</div>      <div style="     position: absolute;     height: 20px;     line-height: 20px;     font-size: 12px;     right: 10px;     top: 10px;     border-radius: 5px;     width: 40px;     text-align: center; 	background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);     color:white; ">专题</div> </a><script> 	$(function(){ 	    $(".video-bg").find('span').click(function(){/*视频播放*/             var _this = this;             var index = $(".video-bg span").index(this);             var MediaArr = document.getElementsByTagName("video");             $(this).parent().hide();             MediaArr[index].play();             MediaArr[index].controls = true;             $(".video-box").each(function(i, item) {                 if ($(this).find('span').get(0) !== _this) {                     $(this).find('.video-bg').show();                     MediaArr[i].pause();                     MediaArr[i].controls = false;                 }             })         });  	if(typeof(canLoadImage)=='function'){/*新版图片打开方式定义*/ 		if(!((typeof(getNetType)==='function' && getNetType()) || canLoadImage())){             $(".img_wrap").css('background-color', '#D9D9DA').find('.play_btn').css('text-indent','0');         } 		var platform = $('input[name="platform"]').val(); 		platform = platform=='ios'?'ios':'android'; 		var img_op = img_op_value = ''; 		function show_small_gif1(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 				img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 				var lineHeight = $(this).find('.play_btn').height();  				if((img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4||img_op_value==7)&&$(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){ 				    $(this).css('background-image',"url('"+$(this).attr("data-thumb")+"')"); 				    $(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('line-height', lineHeight + 'px').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}  		setTimeout(show_small_gif1(),100); 		/*load_type 1=wifi,2=4G&&loadimg,3=4G&&noloadimg*/ 		function load_img(this_obj,load_type,status) { 			img_op = get_img_op_attr(this_obj,platform); 			img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 			/*var img = this_obj.children('img:first');*/ 			var img = this_obj.find('img:eq(0)'); 			if(load_type==1){ 				if(img_op_value==1 || img_op_value==7){ 					if(img.attr('t-rc')==img.attr('src')){ 						open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 					}else{ 						this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 						img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 					} 				}else if(status==1){ 					open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 				} 			}else if(load_type==2&&this_obj.attr('type')=='IMG'){ 				this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 				img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 			} 			if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){                 img.load(function(){                     window.webkit.messageHandlers.imageLoaded.postMessage('test');                 }); 			}else if(platform=='ios'&&typeof(imageLoaded)=='function'){ 				img.load(function(){ 				    /*加载完成*/                     imageLoaded(); 				}); 			} 		}; 		 		var ms = 1000; 		if(platform === 'android'){ 		    ms = 10; 		} 		setTimeout(function(){ 			if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){/*wifi*/ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				load_img($(this),1,0) 				}); 			}else{ 				if(canLoadImage()){/*载入图片*/ 					$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 						load_img($(this),2,0) 					}); 			}else{ 				$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 					load_img($(this),3,0); 				}); 			} 			} 		}, ms);  		$(".img_wrap").click( 				function(){ 				    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url');                     if(jumpUrl){                         return openLink(jumpUrl);                     } 					load_img($(this),1,1); 					event.stopPropagation(); 				} 			); 		$('a').click(function(e){ 			img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 			img_op_value = parseInt(get_op(img_op,platform)); 			if(img_op_value>=0&&img_op_value<=7){ 				open_img(img_op_value,platform,$(this).attr('href')); 				if ( e && e.preventDefault ) 					e.preventDefault(); 				else 					window.event.returnValue = false;  				return false; 			}     	}); 	}else{/*旧版本*/ 		function show_small_gif(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				/*console.log($(this).css('background-image'));*/ 				$(this).find('.play_btn').css("text-indent","0"); 				if($(this).attr("data-ratio") && /gif/i.test($(this).attr("type")) ){                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     $(this).css({width:"100%",height:0,"padding-top":100/ratio+"%"}).find(".play_btn").css({top:0,height:'100%